    - key: 7
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 522ba884f3c6d224cb19c7a59f5dd39b, type: 2}
        description: Eight DBY-827 heavy twin turbolasers lead a durable Republic
          battle line. Ion cannons weaken shields; laser batteries, point defense
          and Delta-7/ARC-170 squadrons protect the fleet.
        role: "Capital \xB7 Heavy gunship / carrier"
        iconKey: 677a9fb4a7566e14d932893ee85f3357:21300000
        isHero: 0
        <Name>k__BackingField: Rothana Star Destroyer
        <MaxCount>k__BackingField: 3
        <AvailableLevel>k__BackingField: 5
        <Price>k__BackingField: 7500
        <BuildTime>k__BackingField: 35
        <UnitCapacity>k__BackingField: 8
        <Icon>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 677a9fb4a7566e14d932893ee85f3357,
          type: 3}
    - key: 8
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c0df2ce6f2e7d2c42b42501e3bf56020, type: 2}
        description: Unique Venator with 7,000 hull and 5,000 shields. SPHA-T Beam
          and Concentrate Fire. Allied ships and squadrons within 400 receive +50%
          vision, +20% hull, +10% shields, damage and speed, and 35% less incoming
          damage. One at a time; replaceable after destruction.
        role: "Hero \xB7 Fleet command carrier"
        iconKey: 8ee3ff50731492c43b11469ff405c5d6:21300000
        isHero: 1
        <Name>k__BackingField: "Resolute \u2014 Admiral Yularen"
        <MaxCount>k__BackingField: 1
        <AvailableLevel>k__BackingField: 4
        <Price>k__BackingField: 6000
        <BuildTime>k__BackingField: 55
        <UnitCapacity>k__BackingField: 3
        <Icon>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8ee3ff50731492c43b11469ff405c5d6,
          type: 3}
    - key: 9
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b92ff58098755ab4baa941419c34f072, type: 2}
        description: Republic dreadnought with 20 turbolaser mounts, eight ion cannons,
          16 point-defense batteries, eight missile and four torpedo launchers. Power
          to Weapons boosts battery output. Deploys Delta-7 and ARC-170 squadrons;
          vulnerable to concentrated bomber attacks and Malevolence.
        role: "Mandator II \xB7 Dreadnought"
        iconKey: 771dbf8529c7a394b864ffcb0bd556d7:21300000
        isHero: 0
        <Name>k__BackingField: Pride of the Core
        <MaxCount>k__BackingField: 1
