        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 07a5885f26b41c34386b125bd4fb6e6a, type: 2}
        description: Five BTL-B heavy bombers, each with 60 hull, 30 shields, two
          lasers and a two-torpedo salvo per attack run. Ion Shot disables a target;
          astromechs repair surviving craft. Effective against large ships and important
          hardpoints; vulnerable to fighters.
        role: "Heavy bomber \xB7 Anti-capital strikecraft"
        iconKey: 8aec8fa8b8581064dbf2721ad11585bb:21300000
        isHero: 0
