        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e5a3e64998bb0b4fa271e997ebf93f6, type: 2}
        description: Four naval bombers, each with 60 hull, 30 shields, laser cannons
          and proton torpedoes. Effective against capital ships, stations and important
          hardpoints; vulnerable to fighters and anti-fighter weapons.
        role: "Naval bomber \xB7 Anti-capital strikecraft"
        iconKey: 83b847ad5990b534c940f6bcc1abfbf1:21300000
        isHero: 0
        <Name>k__BackingField: NTB-630 Naval Bomber Squadron
